WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
Paper 1.

2
00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.280
Under the passage sits
one highlighted line,

3
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:06.500
labelled guiding question.

4
00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:08.110
A pen circles it.

5
00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:09.880
Then crosses it out.

6
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.960
Then hesitates, and
draws the circle again.

7
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:13.840
Answer it?

8
00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:14.790
Ignore it?

9
00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:15.950
Something else?

10
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.120
Do you actually have to use it?

11
00:00:18.170 --> 00:00:22.880
In this mission, you'll ask what a
guiding question is actually there to do.

12
00:00:22.930 --> 00:00:27.930
You'll pull apart a topic and a thesis,
and ask which one an answer needs.

13
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.410
And you'll ask how one sentence
could hold a whole answer together.

14
00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.570
Your mission: decide
whether you have to use it.
